          "alt": "",
          "height": 0,
          "html": "<span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">My things were where I'd left them. Waiting for me.&nbsp;</span>",
          "tag": "P",
          "text": "My things were where I'd left them. Waiting for me. ",
          "width": 0
        },
        {
          "alt": "",
          "height": 0,
          "html": "<span class=\"C9DxTc \" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Putting them on, I abandoned my disguise and became myself, free from fear or weakness or lust.&nbsp;</span>",
          "tag": "P",
          "text": "Putting them on, I abandoned my disguise and became myself, free from fear or weakness or lust. ",
          "width": 0
